ef=\"#cite_note-ENW-RETHMAR-RATHOLE-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"demonym\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Demonym</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Rethmarren</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ENW-RETHMAR-RATHOLE_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ENW-RETHMAR-RATHOLE-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"government\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plutocracy</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0JlbHQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"The Belt (page does not exist)\">The Belt</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ENW-RETHMAR-RATHOLE_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ENW-RETHMAR-RATHOLE-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3,300 (off-season); 3,900 (caravan season) in <a href=\"/wiki/1365_DR\" title=\"1365 DR\">1365 DR</a><br/>4,700 (off-season); 5,500 (caravan season) in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</aside>\n<b>Rethmar</b> was a town in the <a href=\"/wiki/Channath_Vale\" title=\"Channath Vale\">Channath Vale</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Shaar\" title=\"Shaar\">Shaar</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ENW-RETHMAR-RATHOLE_1-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ENW-RETHMAR-RATHOLE-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SS-p156_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p156-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ENW-RETHMAR-ALIVE_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ENW-RETHMAR-ALIVE-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Rethmar?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"></span></td>\n<td><i>This Realmslore article about a geographical location is a <a class=\"extiw\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:stub\" title=\"wikipedia:Wikipedia:stub\">stub</a>.  You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by <a class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Rethmar?action=edit\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">expanding it</a>.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Further_Reading\">Further Reading</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Furt